{"parentUuid":"2a2fe8f4-8fc5-4805-b743-e642687aa2e3","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"4ebb38d0-21a0-49af-a2e5-2733be1f3595","agentId":"ab4fe4e9201583637","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Ca9AsvghS9MfMFGMEGusn8","type":"tool_result","content":"== Ath_Medicine 120-135\n`Concussion_Timeline_Summary.md`'s episode-duration analysis (median 9.5 days/episode) is the\nclosest proxy currently available, but it's concussion-specific — would need a dedicated\ntime-loss field (start/end date per injury) added upstream in Excel to answer this generally.\n\n## Status\nAll 24 columns (A–X) complete as of 2026-06-13. Dataset is ready for both Excel-side structural\nanalysis and Claude Code semantic/NLP analysis. No git repo here — this is a working data\ndirectory, not a code project.\n\n## Carrie's breakdowns (2026-06-13)\n`carrie_breakdowns.py` → `Carrie_Breakdowns_Summary.md`. Implements the 5 requests from Carrie's\n2026-06-13 transcript:\n- **A. Visit Site** — `VisitSite` categorical derived from `Location_Clean` + `Prescriber`:\n  On-Campus (BU Athletics Clinic/Health Center, 6,204), SWSMO (479), Outside Waco - Specialist\n  Referral (Carrell Clinic/Texas Neurology/Orthopedic Specialists of Austin + \"Other\"+Keith Meister\n  = TMI, 72), Waco-area Off-Campus (BSW Health System/Premier ER/Green Eye/Ascension\n== FaceComps 78-88\n- `build-fall-camp-snapshot.ts` — local-only Fall Camp calibration pull. Run from `simulator/` with `npx ts-node --project tsconfig.json --compiler-options '{\"module\":\"CommonJS\"}' scripts/build-fall-c\n\n### Fall Camp 2026 mode — BUILT & DEPLOYED (2026-05-24)\nThe separate Fall Camp mode is implemented and live on `main`. Full handoff detail lives in\n`simulator/AGENTS.md` (read it before touching Fall Camp code). Summary:\n- **Calibration domain abstraction** in `simulator/lib/calibration.ts` (`getDomain`/`listDomains`,\n  `SPRING_2026`/`FALL_CAMP_2026`). Spring uses `PERIOD_DEFAULTS` + no structure zone; Fall Camp uses\n  generated FC baselines (`lib/fallCampLibrary.generated.ts`) + load and structure thresholds.\n  `loadCalc` math + per-period UI components take optional/explicit `baselines`/`thresholds`,\n  defaulting to Spring so Spring is byte-identical.\n- **Data:** 18 defensive Fall Camp faces seeded to the **production** DB under\n== AgentAssist docs\nadoption-ladder.md\neducation-log.md\ngps-pipeline-review.md\nsession-handoff.md\nSTATUS.md\n== Kinexon tests\n/Users/kristinarash/DEV/Kinexon_Volleyball/tests\n/Users/kristinarash/DEV/Kinexon_Volleyball/tests/test_data_quality.py\n/Users/kristinarash/DEV/Kinexon_Volleyball/tests/test_debrief.py\n/Users/kristinarash/DEV/Kinexon_Volleyball/tests/test_build_report.py\n(end)\n== plugin skills\nplugin SKILL.md files (all cached versions): 564 desc chars 141429\nof which under cache/: 429","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"7dff61a2-2370-4953-9ae9-862ef70b0aff","timestamp":"2026-09-13T06:34:30.079Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"== Ath_Medicine 120-135\n`Concussion_Timeline_Summary.md`'s episode-duration analysis (median 9.5 days/episode) is the\nclosest proxy currently available, but it's concussion-specific — would need a dedicated\ntime-loss field (start/end date per injury) added upstream in Excel to answer this generally.\n\n## Status\nAll 24 columns (A–X) complete as of 2026-06-13. Dataset is ready for both Excel-side structural\nanalysis and Claude Code semantic/NLP analysis. No git repo here — this is a working data\ndirectory, not a code project.\n\n## Carrie's breakdowns (2026-06-13)\n`carrie_breakdowns.py` → `Carrie_Breakdowns_Summary.md`. Implements the 5 requests from Carrie's\n2026-06-13 transcript:\n- **A. Visit Site** — `VisitSite` categorical derived from `Location_Clean` + `Prescriber`:\n  On-Campus (BU Athletics Clinic/Health Center, 6,204), SWSMO (479), Outside Waco - Specialist\n  Referral (Carrell Clinic/Texas Neurology/Orthopedic Specialists of Austin + \"Other\"+Keith Meister\n  = TMI, 72), Waco-area Off-Campus (BSW Health System/Premier ER/Green Eye/Ascension\n== FaceComps 78-88\n- `build-fall-camp-snapshot.ts` — local-only Fall Camp calibration pull. Run from `simulator/` with `npx ts-node --project tsconfig.json --compiler-options '{\"module\":\"CommonJS\"}' scripts/build-fall-c\n\n### Fall Camp 2026 mode — BUILT & DEPLOYED (2026-05-24)\nThe separate Fall Camp mode is implemented and live on `main`. Full handoff detail lives in\n`simulator/AGENTS.md` (read it before touching Fall Camp code). Summary:\n- **Calibration domain abstraction** in `simulator/lib/calibration.ts` (`getDomain`/`listDomains`,\n  `SPRING_2026`/`FALL_CAMP_2026`). Spring uses `PERIOD_DEFAULTS` + no structure zone; Fall Camp uses\n  generated FC baselines (`lib/fallCampLibrary.generated.ts`) + load and structure thresholds.\n  `loadCalc` math + per-period UI components take optional/explicit `baselines`/`thresholds`,\n  defaulting to Spring so Spring is byte-identical.\n- **Data:** 18 defensive Fall Camp faces seeded to the **production** DB under\n== AgentAssist docs\nadoption-ladder.md\neducation-log.md\ngps-pipeline-review.md\nsession-handoff.md\nSTATUS.md\n== Kinexon tests\n/Users/kristinarash/DEV/Kinexon_Volleyball/tests\n/Users/kristinarash/DEV/Kinexon_Volleyball/tests/test_data_quality.py\n/Users/kristinarash/DEV/Kinexon_Volleyball/tests/test_debrief.py\n/Users/kristinarash/DEV/Kinexon_Volleyball/tests/test_build_report.py\n(end)\n== plugin skills\nplugin SKILL.md files (all cached versions): 564 desc chars 141429\nof which under cache/: 429","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"2a2fe8f4-8fc5-4805-b743-e642687aa2e3","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV","sessionId":"9823c1f0-89f5-4638-9223-c6892607ac2b","version":"2.1.270","gitBranch":"main"}
